Reference Article to automatically place the reference in the Reference Article.  Also use the Reference Wizard's 
Check Reference feature to update the issue dates.<BRK/>
 <BRK/>
References not used in the text will automatically be deleted from this section of the project specification when 
you choose to reconcile references in the publish print process.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
